{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"提摩太前书","commonName":"提摩太前书","title":"提摩太前书","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"456677ee5f530a55036c148b493beeb4550b2d03494fe29181083852bcdd0746","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["谨防伪君子"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["圣灵明确地说，日后必有人离弃真道，去追随那些迷惑人的邪灵和鬼魔的学说。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这些学说是出自假冒伪善的骗子，他们良心丧尽，麻木不仁",{"noteId":2},"，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["禁止人结婚和吃某些食物。其实那些食物是上帝创造的，为了让相信并且明白真理的人存感恩的心领受。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["上帝所造的一切都是美好的，若以感恩的心去领受，就无需任何禁忌，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因为上帝的道和人的祷告可以使食物圣洁。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你若提醒弟兄姊妹这些事，就是基督耶稣的好仆人，在信仰之道和你所遵行的美善教导上得到了造就。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["做信徒的榜样"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但你要弃绝世俗、荒诞的传说，要训练自己做敬虔的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["锻炼身体益处还少，敬虔生活万事受益，拥有今生和永世的应许。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这话真实可信，值得完全接受。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我们劳苦奋斗正是为此，因为我们的盼望在于永活的上帝。祂是天下人的救主，更是信徒的救主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你要吩咐和教导这些事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["不要因为年轻而叫人小看你，总要在言语、行为、爱心、信心和纯洁各方面做信徒的榜样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["在我来之前，你要专心宣读圣经，勉励会众，教导真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["不要忽略你的恩赐，那是借着预言在众长老把手按在你身上时赐给你的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你要全心全意做这些事，让大家都看到你的长进。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["你要注意自己的言行和教导，并持之以恒。这样，你不但能救自己，也能救那些听你教导的人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"“良心丧尽，麻木不仁”希腊文是“良心被烙铁烫过”。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}